---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
---
<Base title="The Odds Desk" description="How likely is that dodge, rush and pick-up? Build your sequence of rolls and the Odds Desk works out your chances, with team re-rolls, skills, Pro and Loner.">
  <div class="page od-page">
    <p class="od-back"><a href="/tools/">← All tools</a></p>
    <p class="od-kicker">Tools · Dice maths</p>
    <h1>The Odds Desk</h1>
    <p class="od-intro"><em>Every coach knows the feeling. Three dice between you and glory, one re-roll left, and a little voice asking "how bad can it be?" The Odds Desk answers the little voice.</em></p>

    <div id="od-app">
      <div class="od-presets">
        <span class="od-l">Classic plays</span>
        <button type="button" class="od-preset" data-code="s=d3.p3&rr=1&pro=0&loner=0">Dodge and pick up</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-preset" data-code="s=d3.r2.r2&rr=1&pro=0&loner=0">Dodge out, rush twice</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-preset" data-code="s=d3s.d4s&rr=1&pro=0&loner=0">Two-dodge escape</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-preset" data-code="s=p3.t4.c3&rr=1&pro=0&loner=0">Pick up, pass, catch</button>
      </div>

      <h2 class="od-h">Your rolls, in order</h2>
      <ol class="od-steps" id="od-steps"></ol>
      <div class="od-adds">
        <span class="od-l">Add a roll</span>
        <button type="button" class="od-add" data-type="d">+ Dodge</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-add" data-type="r">+ Rush</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-add" data-type="p">+ Pick-up</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-add" data-type="c">+ Catch</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-add" data-type="t">+ Pass</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-add" data-type="o">+ Other roll</button>
        <button type="button" class="od-clear" id="od-clear">Clear all</button>
      </div>

      <h2 class="od-h">Re-rolls in your pocket</h2>
      <div class="od-opts">
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="od-rr" checked> Team re-roll left this turn</label>
        <label>Loner
          <select id="od-loner">
            <option value="0">No</option>
            <option value="2">2+</option>
            <option value="3">3+</option>
            <option value="4">4+</option>
            <option value="5">5+</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="od-pro"> Pro</label>
      </div>

      <div class="od-result" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="od-big"><span class="od-l">Chance it all works</span><span class="od-pct" id="od-pct">-</span></div>
        <div class="od-say">
          <p class="od-verdict" id="od-verdict"></p>
          <p class="od-sub" id="od-sub"></p>
          <div class="od-meter"><span id="od-bar"></span></div>
          <p class="od-facts" id="od-facts"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="btn dark od-share" id="od-share">Copy link to these odds</button>
      <input type="text" class="od-link" id="od-link" readonly hidden aria-label="Link to these odds" />
    </div>

    <h2>How to use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Add your rolls in the order you'll make them. For each one, pick the number you need <strong>after all modifiers</strong> (tackle zones, weather, skills). A 1 always fails and a 6 always passes, so 2+ to 6+ covers everything.</li>
      <li>Tick the skill box if the player has the matching skill. The percentage on each line is your chance to have survived up to that roll.</li>
      <li>Tell the Odds Desk which re-rolls you still have. It spends them in the smartest order, so the number you see is the best you can do.</li>
      <li>Hit "Copy link" to send the exact situation to your opponent. Or your therapist.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How the Odds Desk counts</h2>
    <ul class="od-rules">
      <li>Team re-roll: one per turn. With Loner, roll first and only re-roll on the Loner number or higher. Miss it and the team re-roll is gone.</li>
      <li>Pro: once per turn, a 3+ lets you re-roll one failed roll. Miss it and that roll stays failed.</li>
      <li>Dodge and Sure Feet: once per turn. Sure Hands, Catch and Pass: every failed roll of their type.</li>
      <li>No roll can be re-rolled twice. Pro and the team re-roll each count once for the whole sequence, even if several players are involved.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="od-fine">Rules as we read them in the current rulebook. Spotted something that doesn't match your book? <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=Odds%20Desk`}>Tell us</a> and we'll fix it.</p>
    <p class="od-fine"><strong>Unofficial fan tool.</strong> Not affiliated with or endorsed by Games Workshop. Everything is calculated in your browser. Nothing is stored or sent anywhere.</p>
  </div>

  <style>
    .od-back { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 .6em; }
    .od-back a { text-decoration: none; }
    .od-kicker { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--red); }
    .od-intro { font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .od-l { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
    .od-h { font-size: 1.3rem !important; margin-top: 1.2em !important; }
    .od-presets, .od-adds { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 1em; }
    .od-presets .od-l, .od-adds .od-l { width: 100%; }
    .od-preset, .od-add, .od-clear, .od-t {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 7px 12px; border: 2.5px solid var(--ink); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer;
    }
    .od-preset:hover, .od-add:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
    .od-add:disabled { opacity: .4; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .od-clear { border-color: var(--muted); color: var(--muted); margin-left: auto; }
    .od-steps { list-style: none; padding: 0 !important; margin: .6em 0 0 !important; border: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    .od-steps:empty { display: none; }
    :global(.od-step) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px 110px auto 1fr 64px 34px; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    :global(.od-step:last-child) { border-bottom: none; }
    :global(.od-num) { font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--red); line-height: 1; }
    :global(.od-name) { font-weight: 700; font-size: .85rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    :global(.od-targets) { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    :global(.od-t) { padding: 5px 8px !important; font-size: .78rem !important; min-width: 40px; }
    :global(.od-t[aria-pressed="true"]) { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
    :global(.od-skill) { font-size: .8rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
    :global(.od-noskill) { color: var(--muted); cursor: default; }
    :global(.od-reach) { font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; font-size: 1.15rem; text-align: right; }
    :global(.od-del) { border: none; background: transparent; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); }
    :global(.od-del:hover) { color: var(--red); }
    .od-opts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 28px; margin-top: .6em; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .9rem; }
    .od-opts label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; cursor: pointer; }
    .od-opts select { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .9rem; padding: 4px 6px; border: 2px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
    .od-opts select:disabled { opacity: .45; }
    .od-opts input[type=checkbox], :global(.od-skill input) { width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--red); }
    .od-result { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 210px 1fr; margin-top: 1.4em; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-top-width: 10px; background: var(--paper-dark); }
    .od-big { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 16px 18px; border-right: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    .od-pct { font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; font-size: 3.6rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--red); }
    .od-say { padding: 16px 20px; }
    .od-say p { margin: 0 !important; }
    .od-verdict { font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; font-size: 1.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.05; }
    .od-sub { font-style: italic; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 4px !important; }
    .od-meter { height: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper); margin: 12px 0 10px; }
    .od-meter span { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; background: var(--red); transition: width .25s; }
    .od-facts { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .od-facts :global(strong) { color: var(--ink); }
    .od-share { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 12px; cursor: pointer; }
    .od-link { width: 100%; margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; border: 2px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper); }
    .od-rules li { margin-top: .3em; }
    .od-fine { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      :global(.od-step) { grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr 56px 28px; gap: 6px 8px; }
      :global(.od-targets) { grid-column: 2 / 5; grid-row: 2; }
      :global(.od-skill) { grid-column: 2 / 5; grid-row: 3; }
      :global(.od-reach) { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
      :global(.od-del) { grid-column: 4; grid-row: 1; }
      :global(.od-t) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
      .od-result { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .od-big { border-right: none; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }
      .od-clear { margin-left: 0; }
    }
  </style>
  <script is:inline src="/odds-desk.js" defer></script>
</Base>
